B.fVx=new A.uG("3. Information Sharing and Disclosure","We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances: with your consent, to comply with legal obligations, to protect our rights and safety, with service providers who assist us in operating our platform (under strict confidentiality agreements), and in connection with a business transfer or merger.")
